/*
 * The log sites of the drop-in library. Generated by
 * `cargo xtask log-sites header` from tests/abi/log-sites.tsv and the
 * zk-proto LogSite table. Do not edit.
 *
 * Each row is X(name, level, func, line, line_end, fmt). line is the line
 * of the macro name. line_end is the line of the closing parenthesis,
 * which clang prints.
 *
 * ZKS_CORE_SITES has the core sites in the order of zk_proto::LogSite::ALL,
 * so the row index is the site id of a LOG item. ZKS_C_SITES has the sites
 * that the shim emits itself, in the order of enum zks_c_site.
 */

